# terrace-probe — the roof terrace on its own, for clipcheck.
#
# The contract for the dimensions and the materials, the order because the manifest loads it before
# any fragment and a fragment is entitled to reach for it, then the fragment itself.
#
#   ./build/clipcheck clips/facility/requests/terrace-probe.clip --metre 8
#   ./build/clipcheck clips/facility/requests/terrace-probe.clip --metre 16 --slice y@12.6
#   ./build/clipcheck clips/facility/requests/terrace-probe.clip --metre 32
#
# More than one component is expected and correct here: this part is a paved floor in TWO courts
# either side of the drum — see the long note at the top of terrace.clip about why there is no
# ground north or south of it — with pots, seats, lanterns and an armillary sphere standing on it.
# What matters is WHERE the loose pieces are.

include "../_contract.clip"
include "../_order.clip"
include "../terrace.clip"

solid part_terrace
